2)Create a webpage containing a heading and a button. When the button is 
clicked, change the heading text from “Hello! Welcome” to “Text 
Changed Successfully!”.


<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Text Change Example</title>
</head>
<body>

  <h1 id="heading">Hello! Welcome</h1>
  <button onclick="changeText()">Click Me</button>

  <script>
    function changeText() {
      document.getElementById("heading").textContent =
        "Text Changed Successfully!";
    }
  </script>

