3)Create a webpage containing a button and link. Change their appearance 
when the mouse pointer moves over them. (Use :hover Pseudo-Class) 
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Hover Effect Example</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            padding: 50px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #333;
        }

